@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+"saleor-dashboard": patch
+---
+
+Staff can now mark a product as age restricted from the product page and the create product dialog, and set the store's minimum age (default 18) in site settings. The customer details page shows whether the customer is age eligible and, when the API returns it, their birthday (read-only). These fields need a Saleor API that supports age restriction (3.24 or newer) and are only shown when the dashboard is built with `FF_USE_STAGING_SCHEMA`.
